# ─── Upstash Redis / Vercel KV ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from:
# Option A) Vercel Dashboard → Storage → Create KV Database (uses Upstash)
# Option B) Upstash.com → Create Redis Database → REST API keys (free tier)
#
KV_REST_API_URL=https://your-db.upstash.io
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=your_token_here

# ─── WizRep API (optional — add when/if API access is confirmed) ──────────────
# WIZNREP_API_URL=https://your-wiznrep-instance.com/api
# WIZNREP_USERNAME=your_username
# WIZNREP_PASSWORD=your_password
